sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor C as Client
  participant SPA as SPA React
  participant GW as API Gateway
  participant R as Service Réservation
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant S as Stripe
  participant N as Service Notification
  C->>SPA: Valide le récapitulatif
  SPA->>GW: POST /reservations (JWT)
  GW->>GW: Vérifie JWT RS256
  GW->>R: createReservation()
  R->>DB: BEGIN · vérifie dispo (verrou) · INSERT status=pending
  R->>S: Create PaymentIntent (montant, devise)
  S-->>R: client_secret
  R-->>SPA: 201 + client_secret
  C->>SPA: Saisit la carte (Stripe Elements)
  SPA->>S: confirmCardPayment (3D Secure)
  S-->>SPA: succeeded
  S->>R: Webhook payment_intent.succeeded (signé)
  R->>DB: UPDATE status=confirmed
  R-)N: Événement ReservationConfirmed (queue)
  N-)C: Email de confirmation (SES, < 2 min)
